{"about_the_game":"<strong> Do you like digging? Do you like sand castles? You came to the right place. </strong><br>In this idle game you will feel all the pain when your castle is destroyed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/072ffc319b95ede1a214bc63e2c123dd.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=300 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/072ffc319b95ede1a214bc63e2c123dd.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/072ffc319b95ede1a214bc63e2c123dd.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The famous Sandman puts the one oh his mines at your disposal.<br>Dig the sand with your own hands, dig deeper. Then hire miners for faster progress. The larger the mine, the more miners are available.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/545e4362770cc3592e55081c41a52bfc.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=162 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/545e4362770cc3592e55081c41a52bfc.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/545e4362770cc3592e55081c41a52bfc.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From time to time miners want to rest, but they haven't a lot of time. Be like a real BOSS, don't let them sleep at the workplace<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/650d6ccf489dddb5be3a045134ee6ed1.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=162 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/650d6ccf489dddb5be3a045134ee6ed1.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/650d6ccf489dddb5be3a045134ee6ed1.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Boost the miners' efficiency. Improve the endurance and physical strength of your employees. More then 60 levels of improvements are available.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/7e68a8c2af0c073b1c1803bf889e3140.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=174 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/7e68a8c2af0c073b1c1803bf889e3140.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/7e68a8c2af0c073b1c1803bf889e3140.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Create a sand castle of 30+ level with the height of a skyscraper. Get crazy money from tourists for selfies with the castle. Develop tourism to the maximum.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/d0819dc60224cee57a3de9c79d9e7d32.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=300 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/d0819dc60224cee57a3de9c79d9e7d32.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/d0819dc60224cee57a3de9c79d9e7d32.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But do not forget that your success is already being watched by attackers. Don't let them destroy your castle. <br>Push them away, it's fun. If you can't do it on your own, hire a security guard. Improve the guards' weapon, namely the distance and reloading of the shocker.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/b5bb073b00d3a482e00703cb6f0e67ec.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=148 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/b5bb073b00d3a482e00703cb6f0e67ec.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/b5bb073b00d3a482e00703cb6f0e67ec.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Not everyone is able to achieve the goal, but I believe in you.<br><strong>Good luck) </strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Small sand castle ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/9546a7fb7fa76ecdf9614c7f3a7a9e934a57b213.jpg"},{"name":"Medium sand castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/c7d83c97f2d5485aff73f0321a82c10d2e126291.jpg"},{"name":"Big sand castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/04092e1f97c7e6e342e9058737435239dc75c1ee.jpg"},{"name":"Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/9cb984276d8b72600fb25854a73cc25cb684cb54.jpg"},{"name":"Pickaxe hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/cab1348374f3c429743de202b910ca24220f8b42.jpg"},{"name":"Lord of the sand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/66ffa5f36b328f5a25628ca90248b863b7dd1e45.jpg"},{"name":"Workaholic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/e198a73fff01d745cab8b58966c3d29713146a4c.jpg"},{"name":"Businessman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/78f4d5f858c96dc4133ba39411707b6b9292241a.jpg"},{"name":"Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/1263af408a3eeb8a4c5c0464148288b0b14a2846.jpg"},{"name":"Ordinary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1841100/bed9011a2a3e566816ea2e9213982e572b782c6d.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1841100?t=1643047721","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1643047721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1643047721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1643047721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong> Do you like digging? Do you like sand castles? You came to the right place. </strong><br>In this idle game you will feel all the pain when your castle is destroyed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/072ffc319b95ede1a214bc63e2c123dd.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=300 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/072ffc319b95ede1a214bc63e2c123dd.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/072ffc319b95ede1a214bc63e2c123dd.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The famous Sandman puts the one oh his mines at your disposal.<br>Dig the sand with your own hands, dig deeper. Then hire miners for faster progress. The larger the mine, the more miners are available.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/545e4362770cc3592e55081c41a52bfc.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=162 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/545e4362770cc3592e55081c41a52bfc.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/545e4362770cc3592e55081c41a52bfc.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From time to time miners want to rest, but they haven't a lot of time. Be like a real BOSS, don't let them sleep at the workplace<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/650d6ccf489dddb5be3a045134ee6ed1.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=162 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/650d6ccf489dddb5be3a045134ee6ed1.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/650d6ccf489dddb5be3a045134ee6ed1.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Boost the miners' efficiency. Improve the endurance and physical strength of your employees. More then 60 levels of improvements are available.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/7e68a8c2af0c073b1c1803bf889e3140.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=174 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/7e68a8c2af0c073b1c1803bf889e3140.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/7e68a8c2af0c073b1c1803bf889e3140.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Create a sand castle of 30+ level with the height of a skyscraper. Get crazy money from tourists for selfies with the castle. Develop tourism to the maximum.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/d0819dc60224cee57a3de9c79d9e7d32.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=300 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/d0819dc60224cee57a3de9c79d9e7d32.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/d0819dc60224cee57a3de9c79d9e7d32.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But do not forget that your success is already being watched by attackers. Don't let them destroy your castle. <br>Push them away, it's fun. If you can't do it on your own, hire a security guard. Improve the guards' weapon, namely the distance and reloading of the shocker.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/b5bb073b00d3a482e00703cb6f0e67ec.poster.avif?t=1643047721\" width=148 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/b5bb073b00d3a482e00703cb6f0e67ec.webm?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/extras/b5bb073b00d3a482e00703cb6f0e67ec.mp4?t=1643047721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Not everyone is able to achieve the goal, but I believe in you.<br><strong>Good luck) </strong>","developers":["Oleh Baziv"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841100/header.jpg?t=1643047721","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1841100/430557/1871786bc3b246603d3aa817d0dfc1cdf4946656/1751037566/dash_av1.mpd?t=1643047714","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1841100/430557/1871786bc3b246603d3aa817d0dfc1cdf4946656/1751037566/dash_h264.mpd?t=1643047714","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1841100/430557/1871786bc3b246603d3aa817d0dfc1cdf4946656/1751037566/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1643047714","id":256868492,"name":"Idle Sand Castle Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256868492/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1643047714"}],"name":"Idle Sand Castle","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Oleh Baziv"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"24 Jan, 2022"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i